sequenceDiagram
    actor Sales as "Sales"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant Snap as "mobileSnapshotService: Service"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Order as "orderService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Sales->>UI: Request/refresh offline snapshot
    UI->>+API: GET /api/v1/mobile/snapshot with ETag
    API->>Snap: Build scoped full snapshot
    Snap->>+DB: Read retailer, MLOR, products, prices, campaigns, indicative stock
    DB-->>-Snap: Versioned data
    Snap-->>UI: 200 snapshot or 304 Not Modified
    Sales->>UI: Press Send for local draft
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/orders/sync with clientOrderKey
    API->>Order: Sync and idempotency check
    Order->>+DB: Revalidate scope, base price, campaign and MLOR version
    alt Conditions unchanged
        Order->>+DB: Create order once as PendingApproval
        API-->>-UI: Synchronized order
    else Condition conflict
        API-->>-UI: 409 current conditions, no order created
    else Same clientOrderKey retry
        DB-->>-Order: Return existing result
        API-->>UI: Same order/result
    end
    Note over UI,API: No background sync allocation reservation or stock rejection during sync




